ite schema because `app.py` execution environment lacked PowerShell `PATH` dependencies.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n\n**Current Status:** The layout and synchronization fixes are successfully in place, but a regression was introduced in `index.html` during the last refactor that breaks launching any new match processes.\n\n**Immediate Next Steps:**\n1. **Fix the Python/JS API signature mismatch:**\n   - Open `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html`.\n   - Locate `submitProcess()`.\n   - Change:\n     `const res = await window.pywebview.api.start_process(selectedShortageFiles, selectedWarehouseFiles);`\n   - Back to:\n     `const res = await window.pywebview.api.start_process(JSON.stringify(selectedWarehouseFiles), JSON.stringify(selectedShortageFiles));`\n2. Validate that clicking the \"Start\" button initiates the process and the new `#progress-modal` correctly displays the progress bar updates without crashing.\n\nYou have the 21 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006220414]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006220414.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006245677]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006245677.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790008142552]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790008142552.png\nLa