ngs, and proper error handling. Use pathlib.Path for all file paths. Print progress messages in Arabic.\",\n    \"inherit\": true,\n    \"model\": \"MODEL_PLACEHOLDER_M26\",\n    \"modelTier\": \"MODEL_TIER_INHERIT\"\n  },\n  \"result\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"218cbc5d-e25c-452d-99ba-3004c6d3e6f6\",\n    \"logAbsoluteUri\": \"file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/218cbc5d-e25c-452d-99ba-3004c6d3e6f6/.system_ge\n---\nThe checkpoint summary has been truncated due to hitting max length. Please see the conversation log file for the full conversation."}
